---
---

<section class="dcta" id="cta">
  <div class="wrap dcta-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>The next step</span>
    <h2>Start with <em>Studio</em>.</h2>
    <p>
      Thirty to sixty minutes. Tell Studio what's slow, expensive, or leaking. Leave with a tailored proposal, a live demo, and an SOW you can decide on — before we hang up.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
        Talk to Studio <span class="arr">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-secondary">
        See the platform door
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="promise">
      <span>No deck</span>
      <span>No discovery phase</span>
      <span>Real SOW or your time back</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dcta {
    padding: 140px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background:
      radial-gradient(800px 400px at 50% 0%, var(--color-lavender-50), transparent 70%),
      #fff;
  }
  .dcta-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .dcta .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .dcta h2 {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
  }
  .dcta h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .dcta p {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .row {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .promise {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .promise span::before {
    content: "›";
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
    margin-right: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
